# PhishLens AI Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# Server-side proxy target (used by Next.js Route Handlers to communicate with the FastAPI backend)
# Must NEVER be prefixed with NEXT_PUBLIC_ to prevent leaking the internal backend URL to client bundles.
# Default in development: "http://localhost:8000"
# In production on Vercel: set to your deployed Render service URL: "https://phishlens-ai-backend.onrender.com"
BACKEND_INTERNAL_URL="http://localhost:8000"

# Client-side API URL override (Optional)
# When left empty (default), the browser uses same-origin relative requests (/api/v1/...)
# which are handled securely by the Next.js same-origin API proxy.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=""
